1. WHAT THIS COVERS
================================================================================

All content published in this repository and at
https://cm-itad.github.io/ — including research descriptions,
figures, plots, diagrams, photographs, 3D models and datasets, page copy, and
the design system that presents them — is the work of the members of CM-iTAD
Lab and its named collaborators.

Individual contributors retain authorship of their own research output.
Figures and photographs originate in the lab's own experiments, manuscripts
and documentation; several appear in papers that are published, under review
or in preparation, and remain subject to the terms of their venues.

